{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Removing the depends_on 273a-ae7d-23ac-40c2 blocker: that edge existed only because 273a would create headroom in dispatch_one.py. That headroom already exists (dispatch_one.py is 673/800 LOC after the closed 744a extracted apply phases into dispatch_apply_phases.py). d19d's file_impact is dispatch_one.py (update_one in place), not a dispatch_update.py seam, so 273a is not a prerequisite. 273a marked obsolete (duplicates 744a). See 273a comment for full evidence."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786653651440743001,"uuid":"dc65b027-b054-4eb4-9cdd-b33d5d820d41"}